      "content": "<p data-vmark=\"0000\">广州车展很难记住谁是谁，但风云AURA概念车一眼忘不掉：猎豹蓄力的低趴侧面、瓷器感车漆、珠宝级按键阻尼，把浪漫藏进每一处细节。 </p> <p style=\"text-align: center\" data-vmark=\"0001\"> <a class=\"ithome_super_player\" contenteditable=\"false\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://weibo.com/tv/show/1034:5370354890113027?mid=5370355352866166\"> <img src=\"https://wx3.sinaimg.cn/orj480/001ZzMwgly1iji9w1d22nj60u01hctbq02.jpg\" w=\"640\" h=\"360\"> </a> </p> <p data-vmark=\"0002\"> <a href=\"https://wxaurl.cn/ifBDBTumqdf\" target=\"_blank\" data-wapurl=\"https://wxaurl.cn/ifBDBTumqdf\" data-iosurl=\"ithome://openmp?appid=ithome&amp;path=pages%2Fchannellive%2Fchannelvideo\" data-androidurl=\"ithome://openmp?appid=ithome&amp;path=pages%2Fchannellive%2Fchannelvideo\" data-uwpurl=\"https://wxaurl.cn/ifBDBTumqdf\" data-hosurl=\"https://wxaurl.cn/ifBDBTumqdf\" data-wxmpurl=\"ithome://openmp?appid=ithome&amp;path=pages%2Fchannellive%2Fchannelvideo\">点击关注IT之家视频号</a> </p>",
